{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","压轴一幕"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","クライマックス"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","塞涅会使敌人进入“沉浸”并降低其攻击力。终极技能期间还能自动释放普通攻击"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵に「心酔」を付与し、攻撃力をDOWNさせる。必殺技発動中、強力な通常攻撃を行う"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，塞涅的普通攻击命中敌人时，使其进入持续8秒的“沉浸”状态，攻击力降低10%。处于“沉浸”的敌人阵亡后化为亡魂观众，塞涅至多拥有5个亡魂观众。拥有1000点能量时可主动释放，塞涅消耗200点能量进入激昂的演唱状态，在此期间内，获得120点攻击速度并自动地以自身攻击频率释放普通攻击，释放时消耗100点能量，其能量消耗会随着攻击速度和急速的提升而降低。且普通攻击额外造成目标最大生命值8% + 1.2%的真实伤害和100% ATK的生命削减，额外造成的真实伤害不超过140% ATK。当塞涅能量降低至0点后，将退出激昂演唱状态。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：通常攻撃が敵にヒットした後、8秒間の「心酔」付与し、対象の攻撃力-10%。「心酔」状態の敵が撃破されると、亡魂の観客になる。セレネの亡魂の観客は最大5体まで。SPが1000に達するとアクティブで発動でき、SPを200消費して熱唱状態になる。熱唱状態のセレネは、攻撃速度+120、攻撃モーションなしで通常攻撃を行える、そのたびにSPを100消費し（SP消費量は攻撃速度と速度が高いほど減少）、追加で対象のHP上限×8% + 1.2%の確定ダメージと100% ATKのHP上限減少効果を与える。追加で与える確定ダメージは140% ATKを超えない。自身のSPが0になると、熱唱状態を解除"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":196,"end":203,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":215,"end":222,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":209,"end":217,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":218,"end":222,"tooltip_key":"keyword:hpCut"},{"start":235,"end":243,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":230,"end":238,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":239,"end":247,"tooltip_key":"keyword:hpCut"},{"start":265,"end":273,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","终极技能期间，普通攻击附带的真实伤害提升至目标最大生命值9% + 1.2%，不超过150% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","熱唱状態の通常攻撃による追加の確定ダメージが対象のHP上限×9% + 1.2%にUP（150% ATKを超えない）"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":37,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":32,"end":39,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":43,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","终极技能期间，普通攻击附带的真实伤害提升至目标最大生命值10% + 1.2%，不超过160% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","熱唱状態の通常攻撃による追加の確定ダメージが対象のHP上限×10% + 1.2%にUP（160% ATKを超えない）"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":38,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":33,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":44,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","终极技能期间，普通攻击附带的真实伤害提升至目标最大生命值11% + 1.2%，不超过170% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","熱唱状態の通常攻撃による追加の確定ダメージが対象のHP上限×11% + 1.2%にUP（170% ATKを超えない）"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":38,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":33,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":44,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","终极技能期间，普通攻击附带的真实伤害提升至目标最大生命值12% + 1.2%，不超过180% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","熱唱状態の通常攻撃による追加の確定ダメージが対象のHP上限×12% + 1.2%にUP（180% ATKを超えない）"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":38,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":33,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":44,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","敬请聆听"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","お聴きください"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","塞涅的普通攻击会额外发射多枚弹道。主动释放时，对敌人发射多枚音符弹道。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","通常攻撃は追加で音符を発射。アクティブ効果：敵に複数の音符を発射"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","塞涅的普通攻击会额外发射1枚弹道。当自身获得一名友军施加的非永久属性提升效果时，额外弹道数量增加1枚，至多增加至5枚，通过每名友军至多触发一次。每次释放普通攻击时命中相同目标的后续伤害降低25%。主动释放时，塞涅释放一次特殊的普通攻击，原弹道改为2枚造成150% + 18% ATK伤害的音符弹道。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","通常攻撃は追加で音符を1個発射。味方による非永続的なステータス上昇効果を受けた時、追加の音符数+1、最大5個まで追加可能。この効果は味方1体につき、1回まで発動可能。1回の通常攻撃で複数の音符が同じ敵にヒットした場合、2個目以降のダメージ-25%。アクティブ効果：特殊な通常攻撃を1回行い、音符を2個発射し、1個につき150% + 18% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":131,"end":137,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":163,"end":169,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":127,"end":141,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":159,"end":173,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，每枚音符弹道的伤害提升至160% + 18% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果の音符1個ごとのダメージが160% + 18% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，每枚音符弹道的伤害提升至170% + 18% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果の音符1個ごとのダメージが170% + 18% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，每枚音符弹道的伤害提升至180% + 18% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果の音符1個ごとのダメージが180% + 18% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","消逝之声"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","消えゆく声"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","塞涅对全场敌人造成多段伤害，场上亡魂观众还会为塞涅提供治疗和能量回复。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","フィールド上の敵全体に複数回ダメージを与え、フィールド上にいる亡魂の観客の数に応じて、自身のSPとHPを回復"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","塞涅演唱华丽的乐章，向全场范围扩散音波，造成3次170% + 20% ATK伤害。若场上存在亡魂观众，每名观众都会跟随塞涅的乐章抛撒花瓣，为塞涅回复50点能量和100% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","華麗な歌を歌い、その音波はフィールドに拡散し、敵全体に170% + 20% ATKのダメージを3回与える。観客は花びらを撒き、フィールド上の亡魂の観客1体につき、セレネのSPが50、HPが100% ATK回復"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":80,"end":88,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":94,"end":102,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至180% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが180% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至190% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが190% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至200% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが200% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力，拥有一定数量亡魂观众后额外提升攻击力。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身の攻撃力UP。亡魂の観客が一定数に達すると、追加で自身の攻撃力UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提升9%攻击力，拥有3名亡魂观众时，额外提升6%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+9%。亡魂の観客が3体に達すると、追加で自身の攻撃力+6%"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提升12%攻击力，拥有3名亡魂观众时，额外提升8%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+12%。亡魂の観客が3体に達すると、追加で自身の攻撃力+8%"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提升15%攻击力，拥有3名亡魂观众时，额外提升10%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+15%。亡魂の観客が3体に達すると、追加で自身の攻撃力+10%"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","满场喝彩"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","喝采の嵐"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","终极技能期间消耗能量将会吸引额外的亡魂观众，亡魂观众还会向敌人扔出玫瑰造成真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","熱唱状態中、一定のSPを消費するたびに、追加の亡魂の観客が現れる。亡魂の観客は敵にバラを投げ、確定ダメージを与える"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","塞涅累计通过“压轴一幕”进行3次普通攻击会额外吸引1名亡魂观众，拥有3名或以上亡魂观众时，塞涅脚下将升起舞台进入独唱，期间处于稳定。独唱期间普通攻击每命中15次，场上的每名亡魂观众会向塞涅当前攻击目标抛出一朵玫瑰，每朵玫瑰造成190% ATK真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「クライマックス」による通常攻撃を3回行うたびに、亡魂の観客が1体現れる。亡魂の観客が3体に達すると、セレネの足元からステージがせり上がり、ソロ状態に入る。ソロ状態のセレネは、安定状態になり、通常攻撃が15回ヒットするたびに、各亡魂の観客はそれぞれバラを1本投げ、セレネの攻撃対象に190% ATKの確定ダメージを与える"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":63,"end":65,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"},{"start":113,"end":121,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":88,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"},{"start":141,"end":149,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","亡魂观众抛出玫瑰的真实伤害提升至195% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","バラ1本ごとの確定ダメージが195% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","独唱期间自身被击败后会化作灵体，处于被控制或灵体状态时还会继续释放普通攻击，但造成的伤害下降15%，攻击速度下降30点。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ソロ状態のセレネが撃破されると、霊体に変化。行動阻害中または霊体状態のセレネは通常攻撃を継続できるが、ダメージ-15%、攻撃速度-30"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","亡魂观众抛出玫瑰的真实伤害提升至200% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","バラ1本ごとの確定ダメージが200% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时额外吸引亡魂观众。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、追加の亡魂の観客が現れる"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，塞涅立即吸引2名亡魂观众。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、亡魂の観客が2体現れる"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","悠韵花"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","リモニス・フラワー"]]}